      "prompt": "Explain why \\((a-b)(a^2+ab+b^2)\\) equals \\(a^3-b^3\\).",
      "answer": "Multiply the quadratic by a, then by \\(-b\\):\\[a^3+a^2b+ab^2\\]\\[-a^2b-ab^2-b^3.\\]Add. Both pairs of mixed terms cancel, leaving \\(a^3-b^3\\).",
